        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A vegetated area which overlaps treeless, level, or gently rolling plains characteristic of arctic or subarctic regions, permanently frozen subsoil, and communities of low growing vegetation such as lichens, mosses, and stunted shrubs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
