        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A plain that originally formed in a lacustrine environment, that is, as the bed of a lake, but from which the water has disappeared, by natural drainage, evaporation or other geophysical processes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
