        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A narrow, vertical cave passage, often developed along a joint but not necessarily so. Usually due to solution but sometimes to tension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
