        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A mound of earth-covered ice found in the Arctic, subarctic, and Antarctica that can reach up to 70 metres in height and up to 2 kilometres in diameter.</owl:annotatedTarget>
