        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nuclear power plant is a power plant which uses heat generated by a radioactive decay in a nuclear reactor to convert water into steam in order to drive turbines in electrical generators through pressure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuclear_power_plant</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
