        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A group of hydrous aluminium phyllosilicate (phyllosilicates being a subgroup of silicate minerals) minerals (see clay minerals), that are typically less than 2 micrometres in diameter. Clay consists of a variety of phyllosilicate minerals rich in silicon and aluminium oxides and hydroxides which include variable amounts of structural water.</obo:IAO_0000115>
