            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vivarium is an enclosure for keeping and raising organisms for observation or research. Often, a portion of the ecosystem for a particular species is simulated on a smaller scale, with controls for environmental conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
