        <obo:IAO_0000115>A solid or liquid particle, usually 0.2 micrometers in diameter, on which water vapour condenses, seeding cloud formation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CCN</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cloud seed</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
