        <obo:IAO_0000115>A habitat which supports the persistence and growth of a population of Calyptra moths and which overlaps mesic meadows and edges and clearings in vegetated areas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088</oboInOwl:created_by>
