        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Organ culture is the aseptic culture of complete living organs of animals and plants outside the body in a suitable culture medium. Animal organs must be small enough to allow the nutrients in the culture medium to penetrate all the cells.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">URL:http://www.fao.org/DOCREP/003/X3910E/X3910E18.htm</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
