            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>a type of land degradation in which a relatively dry land region becomes increasingly arid, typically losing its bodies of water as well as vegetation and wildlife.</obo:IAO_0000115>
