        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process during which chemicals that are involved in natural ecosystem processes are transported or transformed, and which impact the activity of biological entities</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>envoPolar</oboInOwl:inSubset>
