            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An irregular land surface which consists of marshy hollows, hummocks, thermokarst depressions and thermokarst lakes formed from the erosion of ice-rich thawing permafrost areas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
